Configuration File for Heisenberg Monte Carlo Validation

SIMULATION_METHOD 3
NUM_STEPS 5000
STEPS_TO_OUTPUT 5000

FILE_ENTRY Ni2AlMn_spin.xyz
FILE_OUTPUT heisenberg_100K.xyz
LATTICE_SIDE 32

ATOM_1 Mn
ATOM_2 Ni
ATOM_3 Al

J_M2 500
J_M3 -200

T_START 100.0

H_START 10.0

FLAG_SAVE_CONFIG false
FLAG_VERBOSE false